<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E28 Conceptual Object"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E28 Conceptual Object is the common superclass of the non-material entities in the model: through E89 Propositional Object and E90 Symbolic Object it subsumes information objects (works, expressions, linguistic objects, passages); it is also the direct superclass of E55 Type, desmos:TextualFeature and intro:INT3_Interrelation (the reified intertextual relations), as well as of intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext, which are referenced only in the original ranges of R12 and R13."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E28 Conceptual Object è la superclasse comune delle entità non materiali del modello: attraverso E89 Propositional Object ed E90 Symbolic Object comprende gli oggetti informativi (opere, espressioni, oggetti linguistici, passaggi); è inoltre superclasse diretta di E55 Type, desmos:TextualFeature e intro:INT3_Interrelation (le relazioni intertestuali reificate), nonché di intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext, referenziate solo nei range originali di R12 e R13."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E28 Oggetto Concettuale"@it .
